# Workshop Guidelines

1. Connect to the college Wi-Fi for internet access.

2. Use your AI tool credits and tokens wisely. Avoid unnecessary prompts.

3. Think before prompting. Give clear and specific instructions.

4. Avoid repeatedly generating the same design or code.

5. Bring your laptop and keep your GitHub account ready.

6. Never share passwords or API keys.

7. Test your website and save your work regularly.

8. Focus on completing the main requirements first.

**Remember:** Build smart, save your tokens and make every prompt count!
